invented and executed by Heinrich Scheibler, silk manufacturer in Crefeld.' (*Der physikalische und musikalische Tonmesser*, &c.)—Essen, G. D. Bädeker, 1834, pp. viii. 80, 5 lithographed Tables (called 3 on title-page), and an engraving of tuning-forks and waves. @@ANCHOR@@
