A most remarkable pamphlet, but unfortunately very obscurely written, as the author says in his preface, 'to write clearly and briefly on a scientific subject is a skill (*Fertigkeit*) I do not possess, and have never attempted.' See also App. XX. sect. B. No. 7. @@ANCHOR@@
